{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.PhiQCategoricalTruncation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.PhiQCategoricalTruncation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.phi_q_categorical_truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.phi_q_categorical_truncation","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L73-L103","doc":"Truncation invariance for k ≥ k★(T_w). The vanishing hypothesis is\nderived from the `SpectralSequenceCollapse` bundle, not assumed —\nThe theorem is non-tautological: it asserts that the structural\nspectral-sequence input *forces* the truncation invariance. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:phi-q-categorical-truncation","label":"conj:phi-q-categorical-truncation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.categoricalBraneTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.categoricalBraneTower","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L65-L71","doc":"The categorical brane-tower contribution: a finite sum over\ncurvature-rank strata up to the NF-support depth k★(T_w). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.vanishing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.vanishing","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The mass functional vanishes on E_∞^{p,*} for p ≥ 1 — equivalently,\nthe depth-j stratum contributes zero whenever j > k_star. This is\nthe substantive content extracted from\n`prop:spectral-sequence-collapse`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.k_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.k_star","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The NF-support depth k★(T_w): max GB-depth of λ ∈ supp(T_w). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.SpectralSequenceCollapse","kind":"structure","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L46-L63","doc":"Hypothesis bundle: the GB spectral sequence collapses to E_∞^{0,*} =\nZ(A), with E_∞^{p,*} = 0 for p ≥ 1. This is the structural input\nfrom `prop:spectral-sequence-collapse` that drives the truncation\nresult — packaged here as a typeclass-style record so the\ntruncation theorem **derives** the higher-depth vanishing rather\nthan assuming it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.plancherel_weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.plancherel_weight","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The q-deformed Wedderburn-block weight of a partition (tilde w_λ\n= dim_q²/[n]_q!). Field name retained for backward compatibility;\ndistinct from the classical Plancherel measure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.depth","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The GB-depth of a central idempotent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.centre","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.centre","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The centre Z(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.algebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.algebra","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.GBStratifiedAlgebra","kind":"structure","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-categorical-truncation.lean#L33-L44","doc":"Abstract setup: a GB-filtered semisimple algebra A = H_n(R, q),\nits centre Z(A), and the curvature-rank stratification. ","signatureChunk":0}]}